Comment: 0,0:04:35.82,0:04:38.59,Sign,,0000,0000,0000,,Typeset
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.47,0:00:19.62,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.07,0:00:21.23,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.36,0:00:28.75,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.95,0:00:34.53,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It was just a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.53,0:00:35.93,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.80,0:00:43.75,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.13,0:02:43.20,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Here you go. I'm counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.85,0:02:50.89,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,We used to make them at Grandpa's place too!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.28,0:02:53.88,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.97,0:03:02.03,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I want my own kitchen knife.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.97,0:03:05.13,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Isn't it a little too soon for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.13,0:03:06.94,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,They have a version for kids too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.94,0:03:08.04,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.16,0:03:14.50,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'll think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.41,0:03:17.51,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,All right, finish eating.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.51,0:03:18.96,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,We have to leave soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.80,0:03:36.29,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Isn't that baby cute?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.29,0:03:39.38,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.43,0:03:47.87,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm Kawachi, a relative of Kaga Rin-san's father.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.26,0:03:52.08,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-san... Rin and I are currently living together.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.56,0:03:55.04,Usaghi Main I,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.47,0:03:58.64,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Um, you {\i0}are{\i1} Yoshii Masako-san,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.64,0:04:01.27,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin's mother, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.27,0:04:02.72,Usaghi Main I,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.03,0:04:05.37,Usaghi Main I,,0000,0000,0000,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.37,0:04:07.13,Usaghi Main I,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Well, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.08,0:04:10.88,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'd like to talk to you face to face.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.88,0:04:13.09,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,A location close to you is fine,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.09,0:04:15.06,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,so please pick a place where we could meet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.06,0:04:17.97,Usaghi Main I,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Place? Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.97,0:04:21.22,Usaghi Main I,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Let's see... Near the shopping district{\fscx250}-
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.22,0:04:24.99,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, but I don't know where you live.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.59,0:04:40.33,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,They're so cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.33,0:04:42.59,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Nice job making them, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.93,0:04:44.42,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,You made this flower too?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.42,0:04:47.08,Usaghi Main,mom,0000,0000,0000,,That's right. It's called embroidery.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.01,0:04:50.34,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.34,0:04:54.39,Usaghi Main,mom,0000,0000,0000,,I'll teach you how to do it when you're a little older.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.39,0:04:55.57,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.57,0:04:58.00,Usaghi Main,mom,0000,0000,0000,,You have a talent for this stuff, Rin-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.41,0:05:02.65,Usaghi Main,dad,0000,0000,0000,,So, what do you plan to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.82,0:05:05.74,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I won't know until I meet her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.06,0:05:08.42,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Well then, I'll leave Rin to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.87,0:05:10.00,Usaghi Main,dad,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.47,0:05:12.96,Usaghi Main,dad,0000,0000,0000,,This is important.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.96,0:05:14.96,Usaghi Main,dad,0000,0000,0000,,Take your time talking to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.96,0:05:17.37,Usaghi Main,dad,0000,0000,0000,,Mom has been looking forward to spending time with Rin-chan too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.88,0:05:30.51,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,This really {\i1}is{\i0} close to Grandpa's house.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.37,0:05:32.65,Usaghi Main,waitress,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.65,0:05:34.36,Usaghi Main,waitress,0000,0000,0000,,Table for one?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.36,0:05:35.98,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Another person will be joining me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.47,0:05:37.23,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Non-smoking.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.51,0:05:40.15,Usaghi Main,lady,0000,0000,0000,,You're going to spill it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.36,0:05:41.68,Usaghi Main,lady,0000,0000,0000,,The stress just keeps building up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.68,0:05:43.09,Usaghi Main,lady,0000,0000,0000,,I know what you mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.09,0:05:44.53,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,One American, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.53,0:05:46.97,Usaghi Main,waitress,0000,0000,0000,,Right, one American.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.97,0:05:48.67,Usaghi Main,waitress,0000,0000,0000,,Will that be all?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.67,0:05:49.47,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.28,0:05:52.18,Usaghi Main Top,guy,0000,0000,0000,,Nice, Saionji-sensei!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.18,0:05:53.45,Usaghi Main Top,guy,0000,0000,0000,,As expected from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.45,0:05:57.35,Usaghi Main Top,guy,0000,0000,0000,,All that's left is to give each character two or three traumas.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.35,0:05:58.84,Usaghi Main Top,lady,0000,0000,0000,,Isn't that a bit too much?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.84,0:06:01.26,Usaghi Main Top,guy,0000,0000,0000,,No, I think that would make it perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.50,0:06:02.98,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,This is weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.98,0:06:05.67,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,She went to all that trouble to hide her existence at Grandpa's place,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.67,0:06:07.73,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,but she still lives so close by.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.73,0:06:10.32,Usaghi Main Top,guy,0000,0000,0000,,I'll leave the rest to you, Sensei.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.32,0:06:12.04,Usaghi Main Top,lady,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you for your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.00,0:06:15.63,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Not very smart for someone who ran away.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.63,0:06:17.44,Usaghi Main Top,kid,0000,0000,0000,,Mom, I have to pee!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.44,0:06:19.35,Usaghi Main Top,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Right, just hold it for a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.14,0:06:26.28,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Hello. Where are you right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.53,0:06:28.78,Usaghi Main,Misako,0000,0000,0000,,I'm already in the restaurant.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.04,0:06:41.03,Usaghi Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Souichi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.03,0:06:43.43,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,No, I'm his grandson.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.56,0:06:53.14,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,She's like a little kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.01,0:06:56.23,Usaghi Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry about earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.23,0:06:57.98,Usaghi Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,You look so much like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.98,0:06:59.16,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Not a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.16,0:07:01.29,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Someone else said the same thing to me recently.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.70,0:07:04.07,Usaghi Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,However,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.28,0:07:07.31,Usaghi Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Souichi-san looked a lot kinder.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.92,0:07:12.57,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I brought a picture of Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.53,0:07:14.75,Usaghi Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.34,0:07:17.47,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It was taken at the beginning of this year
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.47,0:07:19.66,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,during a rice-cake cooking competition at school.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.18,0:07:26.88,Usaghi Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,She looks like a young lady already.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.16,0:07:38.07,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I heard someone call you "Sensei" earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.78,0:07:40.05,Usaghi Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,You were watching?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.05,0:07:41.31,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,But the name is{\fscx250}-
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.31,0:07:42.72,Usaghi Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,That's my pen name.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.72,0:07:45.58,Usaghi Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry. I was up all night yesterday because of a deadline,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.58,0:07:47.07,Usaghi Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,so I kind of spaced out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.65,0:07:56.38,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Did you leave Rin because of your work?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.80,0:07:58.27,Usaghi Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.27,0:08:01.52,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It seems you made Rin believe that you were a maid.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.52,0:08:03.95,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Was that from when she was a baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.80,0:08:06.85,Usaghi Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,It's true that my work was the reason,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.85,0:08:11.32,Usaghi Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,but it's also true that I was Souichi-san's maid.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.59,0:08:16.72,Usaghi Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,I was determined not to think of Rin as my daughter even while I was pregnant.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.72,0:08:19.14,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I-I'm sorry. I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.14,0:08:20.97,Usaghi Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Back then, my books didn't sell.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.29,0:08:25.51,Usaghi Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Right when I got a major assignment, I found out I was pregnant.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.13,0:08:28.98,Usaghi Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,It's not the kind of work you can do while raising a kid,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.98,0:08:31.74,Usaghi Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,but Souichi-san insisted that I have the baby regardless.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.74,0:08:36.07,Usaghi Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,I'd either be working or sleeping and got fatter by the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.51,0:08:38.20,Usaghi Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Oddly enough,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.38,0:08:43.01,Usaghi Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,when Rin was born, she was so cute that I loved her a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.44,0:08:45.12,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,She thinks that's weird?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.76,0:08:50.32,Usaghi Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,That's why, while telling myself I wasn't her mother,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.32,0:08:53.34,Usaghi Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,I tried my best to balance Rin and work.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.34,0:08:57.41,Usaghi Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,It was tough, what with having work in the morning,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.41,0:08:59.77,Usaghi Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,and having to go out at night for meetings.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.77,0:09:01.19,Usaghi Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,I'd have to stay up late at night,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.19,0:09:03.43,Usaghi Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,which was physically impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.80,0:09:14.47,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I heard that Rin would stay with you in your apartment at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.47,0:09:15.27,Usaghi Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.27,0:09:17.45,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Did you go out at night, even then?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.73,0:09:20.25,Usaghi Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Well, it would be pretty late.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.25,0:09:22.52,Usaghi Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Rin was asleep, so I'd step out for a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.96,0:09:25.21,Usaghi Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Sometimes I'd have Souichi-san look after her too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.58,0:09:29.95,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin still wakes up in the middle of the night once in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.41,0:09:33.08,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Didn't you ever think about how she would feel
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.08,0:09:36.02,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,in a situation like that when no one's beside her?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.02,0:09:39.43,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Then how was I supposed to raise a kid on my own?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.43,0:09:43.04,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,That's why my grandfather wanted you to be part of the family, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.52,0:09:50.26,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Do you have anything against Rin continuing to live with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.95,0:09:52.89,Usaghi Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.10,0:09:56.72,Usaghi Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not her mother anymore,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.72,0:09:59.30,Usaghi Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,so I don't have the right to decide her future.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.30,0:10:03.58,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Even though it's a fact that Rin was once in your belly?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.58,0:10:05.95,Usaghi Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,That has nothing to do with this!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.28,0:10:09.92,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,How do you feel about Rin?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.92,0:10:12.56,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Is she important to you or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.76,0:10:16.34,Usaghi Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.48,0:10:34.25,Usaghi Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Um, I have a favor to ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.25,0:10:35.44,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.96,0:10:40.68,Usaghi Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,When she goes to school, please let her use your surname.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.44,0:10:42.43,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,My surname?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.43,0:10:44.25,Usaghi Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,If her surname is different from her guardian's,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.25,0:10:46.12,Usaghi Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure she'll have a rough time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.12,0:10:48.50,Usaghi Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Can you promise me that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.99,0:10:52.35,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I understand your feelings,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.35,0:10:54.83,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,but I can't promise that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.83,0:10:57.04,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,She's always been Kaga Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.04,0:11:00.87,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I don't think it's that easy to just change someone's name.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.87,0:11:02.73,Usaghi Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,As a woman,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.73,0:11:05.75,Usaghi Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,I don't have any love or attachment for my surname.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.75,0:11:08.90,Usaghi Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,It might change someday anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.24,0:11:10.86,Usaghi Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Rin is a girl too,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.86,0:11:12.89,Usaghi Main,masako,0000,0000,0000,,so I bet she feels the same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.89,0:11:16.13,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,But Rin is only six.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.37,0:11:18.84,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Besides, what I'm trying to say is...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.84,0:11:21.28,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,That's just your opinion{\fscx250}-
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.28,0:11:23.23,Usaghi Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,There's only one important thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.23,0:11:25.91,Usaghi Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,That is the name "Rin," which she got from Souichi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.91,0:11:27.66,Usaghi Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,That is all. Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.06,0:11:30.12,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.66,0:11:34.37,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,As a man, I don't really understand what you're saying,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.37,0:11:37.24,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,but I can talk to Rin about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.24,0:11:38.90,Usaghi Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Talk to her about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.90,0:11:41.22,Usaghi Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Making such a little girl decide...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.22,0:11:42.28,Usaghi Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Isn't that too cruel{\fscx250}-
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.28,0:11:43.09,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.29,0:11:47.89,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm thinking about what's best for Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.89,0:11:52.06,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Besides, deciding without her consent would be cruel.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.06,0:11:54.34,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I have to listen to Rin's opinion first.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.53,0:11:56.58,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,After that, we will make the decision together
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.58,0:11:58.32,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,and let you know what happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.97,0:12:13.92,Usaghi Main,mom,0000,0000,0000,,She sounds like a bad person.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.92,0:12:14.71,Usaghi Main,mom,0000,0000,0000,,Definitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.98,0:12:18.21,Usaghi Main,mom,0000,0000,0000,,Besides, abandoning such a cute, little child... {Not sure if we should move this and the next couple lines to the top, since there is random Japanese text. -mushu}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.21,0:12:19.33,Usaghi Main,mom,0000,0000,0000,,It defies reason!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.59,0:12:22.52,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Well, she {\i1}does{\i0} worry about Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.52,0:12:24.97,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's just that she's a little weird,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.97,0:12:27.47,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,or rather, she isn't aware of getting others involved.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.47,0:12:28.85,Usaghi Main,mom,0000,0000,0000,,What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.85,0:12:31.22,Usaghi Main,mom,0000,0000,0000,,It's only natural for a mother to worry about her daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.22,0:12:33.39,Usaghi Main,mom,0000,0000,0000,,If she really was worried, she'd want to see her kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.39,0:12:36.80,Usaghi Main,dad,0000,0000,0000,,Now, now. She must've had a good reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.80,0:12:37.58,Usaghi Main,dad,0000,0000,0000,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.30,0:12:41.88,Usaghi Main,mom,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder what Grandpa ever saw in her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.88,0:12:45.67,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's a little too late to be thinking about that now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.67,0:12:50.20,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's just that she wants Rin to use my surname when she starts school.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.85,0:12:53.16,Usaghi Main,mom,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, I agree with that too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.02,0:12:58.35,Usaghi Main,mom,0000,0000,0000,,It's obviously better for a kid to have the same surname as her guardian.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.35,0:13:01.34,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I understand that, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.55,0:13:03.96,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,How am I supposed to explain that to Rin?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.96,0:13:05.53,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,She already has a name of her own.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.53,0:13:07.55,Usaghi Main,mom,0000,0000,0000,,Well, she's a girl,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.55,0:13:11.13,Usaghi Main,mom,0000,0000,0000,,so her surname will change when she gets married anyway. {Japanese text again, so move to top? -mushu}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.13,0:13:12.43,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,That again?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.43,0:13:13.92,Usaghi Main,mom,0000,0000,0000,,What do you mean, "again"?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.92,0:13:16.95,Usaghi Main,mom,0000,0000,0000,,It's better for her to use our surname at school,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.95,0:13:19.75,Usaghi Main,mom,0000,0000,0000,,so no one says something to hurt her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.46,0:13:23.26,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You think she'll understand all that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.26,0:13:26.95,Usaghi Main,mom,0000,0000,0000,,A lot of stuff will happen once she gets into elementary school.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.95,0:13:28.95,Usaghi Main,mom,0000,0000,0000,,That's just how it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.37,0:13:34.83,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,In that case, I'll adopt Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.15,0:13:36.29,Usaghi Main,mom,0000,0000,0000,,Wha...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.29,0:13:37.87,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,If she's okay with it,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.87,0:13:39.77,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,then she really will be Kawachi Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.77,0:13:42.02,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, that's more natural.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.02,0:13:45.59,Usaghi Main,mom,0000,0000,0000,,Don't just casually talk about something that important!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.59,0:13:46.95,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not being casual!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.95,0:13:48.61,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,This matter needs to be settled anyway!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.61,0:13:50.13,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Who cares when you settle it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.13,0:13:51.22,Usaghi Main,Dad,0000,0000,0000,,Now, now, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.22,0:13:52.41,Usaghi Main,mom,0000,0000,0000,,It's not the same!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.41,0:13:54.47,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, it certainly is!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.05,0:13:58.57,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not passing the baton to someone else anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.77,0:14:01.73,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,That would be the worst thing I could do to Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.41,0:14:07.71,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,If it's for Rin, I'll take the plunge.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.82,0:14:11.83,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.56,0:14:14.57,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,This is for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.57,0:14:16.23,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, it's yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.23,0:14:19.70,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,But you're only allowed to use it when I'm with you, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.02,0:14:22.34,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,As long as you keep that promise, you're allowed to use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.09,0:14:24.09,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.76,0:14:28.96,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I'll make some curry!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.96,0:14:30.59,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.59,0:14:31.27,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Today!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.27,0:14:33.89,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Why not tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.30,0:14:41.13,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.13,0:14:43.92,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Do I move it towards me or away from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.92,0:14:46.01,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.01,0:14:47.09,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Let me see.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.44,0:14:51.90,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You do it like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.90,0:14:53.88,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, you're good at this!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.88,0:14:56.79,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I've lived alone for a long time, you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.79,0:14:58.25,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Here, give it a shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.25,0:14:59.71,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Take your time with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.32,0:15:13.02,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Don't drink the bath water.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.02,0:15:13.92,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.15,0:15:24.02,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Now, sink your shoulders in, and count to ten.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.62,0:15:27.50,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,One... two...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.50,0:15:33.05,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,three even, four, only, five, pentagram, six, crocodile, seven, eighnine...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.37,0:15:33.68,Usaghi Main Top,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,three... four... five...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.68,0:15:34.82,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, you're too slow!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.76,0:15:34.82,Usaghi Main Top,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,six... {TIMING: It's a bit weird here, but I'm not sure how you could change it. -mushu}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.38,0:15:42.06,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Don't eat it too fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.06,0:15:42.90,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.28,0:15:45.52,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Say, Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.52,0:15:46.81,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.81,0:15:47.89,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.31,0:15:53.34,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,The curry you made is delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.12,0:16:09.23,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Do you need to do it that many times?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.42,0:16:11.42,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.38,0:16:15.50,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You know,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.32,0:16:19.12,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not your dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.12,0:16:20.01,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.47,0:16:22.33,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,But I'm not your brother either.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.62,0:16:26.00,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,No one thinks that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.00,0:16:27.33,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm trying to make a point.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.33,0:16:29.50,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,So, what am I to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.86,0:16:30.99,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.23,0:16:33.32,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,That's just my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.32,0:16:36.86,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Listen, if you're not against it...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.86,0:16:39.70,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Well, how should I say this...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.10,0:16:43.08,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,If I were...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.46,0:16:46.53,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,If I were to become your father...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.53,0:16:48.18,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.07,0:16:51.78,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,You would... be my father?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.98,0:16:57.74,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,If that were to happen, your name would become Kawachi Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.74,0:17:00.20,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Kawachi... Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.04,0:17:04.03,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.52,0:17:06.79,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,"No way"?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.79,0:17:08.88,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Don't you think it'd be better if you had a father?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.43,0:17:11.56,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,My father is Grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.56,0:17:14.31,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I like my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.31,0:17:16.41,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's the same as Grandpa's,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.41,0:17:17.30,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,so it's important.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.97,0:17:21.10,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.45,0:17:24.31,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I like you just the way you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.36,0:17:30.55,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.05,0:17:32.22,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.22,0:17:33.67,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Are you crying?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.67,0:17:35.15,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,This is just sweat!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.81,0:17:37.60,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's only March.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.60,0:17:39.72,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Be quiet! Just open your mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.72,0:17:42.06,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I did, but you were crying!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.06,0:17:43.33,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I said I wasn't crying!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.81,0:17:47.32,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,A little higher.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.32,0:17:48.21,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.21,0:17:53.81,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,This place will always be your home, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.82,0:17:55.81,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.11,0:19:53.42,Usaghi Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.77,0:20:06.53,Usaghi Main,guy,0000,0000,0000,,You're gonna get fat, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.79,0:20:10.40,Usaghi Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,It's fine. I'm a bad person anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.57,0:20:12.52,Usaghi Main,guy,0000,0000,0000,,Can I have one?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.82,0:20:13.70,Usaghi Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.33,0:22:00.35,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,That's only for babies!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.35,0:22:02.13,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Sayaka-chan said that too.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.70,0:22:04.50,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Of course not!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.50,0:22:07.39,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,There are times when adults want to be held too.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.48,0:22:10.26,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.26,0:22:12.33,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know either.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.33,0:22:14.72,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Is it still okay, even after becoming a first grader?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.72,0:22:16.46,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Sure it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.01,0:22:24.30,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'll hold you in my arms no matter how old you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.13,0:22:30.26,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.26,0:22:31.29,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.29,0:22:33.97,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I should've given you a hug that time.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.86,0:22:40.48,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,The next time you cry, I'll give you a hug.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.76,0:22:43.31,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What on Earth...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.68,0:22:46.57,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,No worries!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.47,0:22:52.02,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Am I raising Rin, or is she raising me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.54,0:22:54.33,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I often wonder about that.
